    <p class="text-emerald-600 font-bold tracking-[3px] mb-5">
      DISCOVER THE WORLD
    </p>

    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold leading-tight mb-6">
      Explore Beautiful Places Around The World
